    "name": "Bulk Hot Italian Sausage",
    "description": "<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Our Bulk Hot Italian Sausage is a bold, flavorful classic, packed with lightly crushed fennel, smoky paprika, and a nice spicy kick. This versatile sausage can elevate nearly any meal - add it to pasta, lasagna, top a pizza, or use in soups. With a spiciness level of 6/10, it delivers a balanced heat that enhances every bite. Ingredients: Pork, white wine, sea salt, fresh garlic, fennel, fresh parsley, fresh oregano, sugar, pepper, paprika, cayenne, crushed chile pepper.&nbsp;</span>",
